                        "entry_id": "430e7c03-d249-359a-af08-87fa0ff64cbd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An eight-day Jewish festival, starting on the 25th day of Kislev, which commemorates the rededication of the temple in Jerusalem after the victory of the Maccabees over the Greek Syrians."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Judaism"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bf9301f-1a58-438b-a687-75c84287c40a",
                                "sense_id": "cab6877c-e049-37b4-9931-e520f5d7958a",
                                "text": "Rebecca and Roni Kopelman have been celebrating Christmas and Hanukkah since they got together in 2006, building the foundations of an interfaith household."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
